<title>CROATIA: Croatia tourism figures rise strongly in May.</title>
<headline>Croatia tourism figures rise strongly in May.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Bureau of Statistics issued the following tourism figures.</p>
<p>				     MAY   Change y/y (pct)   APRIL</p>
<p>    Total tourists	   405,765	+52	    206,813</p>
<p>    -Croatian		  132,277	+25	     87,418</p>
<p>    -Foreign		   273,488	+70	    119,395</p>
<p>    Overnights	     1,523,721	+66	    358,174</p>
<p>NOTES -- The 1996 figures are not available, but the tourist trade accounted for some 4-5 percent of Croatia's gross domestic product (GDP) last year, and was the country's main hard currency earner. -- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
